    <blurb shelf="engineering">An interactive textbook for ENGS 28: Embedded Systems at Dartmouth's Thayer School of Engineering. Covers microcontroller programming, GPIO, UART, ADC, timers, interrupts, I2C, motor control, sensors, wireless communication, and power management using the STM32 Nucleo-64 board.</blurb>

